  "premise": "Flum Apricot, a girl with zero stats chosen by divine revelation to join the Hero's party, is sold into slavery by the party's sage. Facing death for a slave trader's entertainment, she grabs a cursed sword and learns her power of 'Reversal' turns curses into strength. She escapes with Milkit, another enslaved girl, and the two try to build an ordinary life together amid church intrigue and horror-tinged monsters. A 'grimdark' fantasy per its publisher, Seven Seas.",
